ighlight multi-currency support and European compliance certifications\",dueDate:\"2024-04-24\",priority:\"High\",status:\"Completed\",assignedTo:\"Sarah Chen\",targetType:\"opportunity\",targetId:\"opp-4\",targetName:\"Stripe International Billing Pilot\",createdAt:\"2024-04-14T09:00:00Z\",completedAt:\"2024-04-21T16:00:00Z\"}],Fg=[{id:\"act-1\",type:\"meeting\",title:\"Executive alignment call with Guillermo Rauch\",content:\"Guillermo confirmed their engineering leads love the API flexibility. We agreed on an enterprise multi-year term with custom uptime SLA. Next step is legal wrap-up.\",author:\"Sarah Chen\",targetType:\"opportunity\",targetId:\"opp-1\",createdAt:\"2024-04-20T14:30:00Z\",meta:{durationMinutes:45}},{id:\"act-2\",type:\"stage_change\",title:\"Stage moved to Negotiation\",content:\"Sarah Chen moved stage from Proposal Sent to Negotiation (Probability: 80%)\",author:\"Sarah Chen\",targetType:\"opportunity\",targetId:\"opp-1\",createdAt:\"2024-04-20T14:35:00Z\",meta:{fromStage:\"proposal\",toStage:\"negotiation\"}},{id:\"act-3\",type:\"email\",title:\"Sent Proposal & Security Whitepaper\",content:\"Hi Karri, attached is the revised proposal with the 150-seat volume pricing along with our SOC2 Type II audit report for your security team.\",author:\"Alex Morgan\",targetType:\"opportunity\",targetId:\"opp-2\",createdAt:\"2024-04-18T10:00:00Z\",meta:{emailSubject:\"Clientum CRM Proposal & Security Packet for Linear\"}},{id:\"act-4\",type:\"note\",title:\"Technical Integration Notes\",content:\"Supabase requires automatic bidirectional sync with their production Postgres instances. Our webhook triggers will handle this seamlessly.\",author:\"Marcus Vance\",targetType:\"opportunity\",targetId:\"opp-3\",createdAt:\"2024-04-19T08:15:00Z\"},{id:\"act-5\",type:\"ai_insight\",title:\"AI Deal Health Analysis\",content:\"Strong buy signals detected: High engagement from decision-makers, contract terms are standard, 85% probability to close this quarter.\",author